Also Village houses: let me find open spots. Rather than hand-tune, implement auto-relocation: for each spawn, if `G.world.collide(x,z,0.6)` then scan rings until free, update home to the free spot.

Do that for both chickens and deer. Also ensure home itself free.

Implement in AnimalManager.build after creating each animal: `a.relocate()`.

Add method:

```js
_freeSpot(x, z, radius) {
  const w = G.world;
  if (!w.collide(x, z, 0.6)) return { x, z };
  for (let r = 2; r < 20; r += 2) {
    for (let i = 0; i < 8; i++) {
      const a = (i / 8) * Math.PI * 2;
      const nx = x + Math.cos(a) * r, nz = z + Math.sin(a) * r;
      if (!w.collide(nx, nz, 0.6)) return { x: nx, z: nz };
    }
  }
  return { x, z };
}
